@startuml SEQ_03_LUPA_RESET_PASSWORD
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-03 · Lupa & Reset Password\nAktor: Publik

actor       "Publik"                      as Publik
boundary    "Browser"                     as Browser
control     "PasswordResetLinkController" as CtrlLink
control     "NewPasswordController"       as CtrlReset
entity      "User Model"                  as Model
collections "Mail / Notification"         as Mail
database    "password_reset_tokens"       as DB

note over CtrlLink, CtrlReset
  Middleware: guest
  (kedua controller dilindungi middleware guest)
end note

== Skenario A: Request Link Reset Password ==

Publik -> Browser  : Akses /forgot-password
Browser -> CtrlLink : GET /forgot-password [middleware: guest]
CtrlLink --> Browser : Inertia::render('Auth/ForgotPassword', {status})
Browser --> Publik  : Tampil form input email

Publik -> Browser  : Isi email → klik Kirim Link Reset
Browser -> CtrlLink : POST /forgot-password\n{email}
CtrlLink -> CtrlLink : validate()\nemail: required|email
alt Validasi Gagal
  CtrlLink --> Browser : 422 + errors
  Browser --> Publik   : Tampil pesan email tidak valid
else Validasi Lolos
  CtrlLink -> Model   : Password::sendResetLink({email})
  Model -> DB         : SELECT users WHERE email = ?
  alt Email Tidak Ditemukan
    DB --> Model      : null
    Model --> CtrlLink : status: passwords.user (not found)
    CtrlLink --> Browser : 422 + errors {email: 'We can\'t find a user...'}
    Browser --> Publik   : Tampil pesan email tidak terdaftar
  else Email Ditemukan
    DB --> Model      : row user
    Model -> DB       : INSERT password_reset_tokens\n(email, token=SHA256, created_at)
    Model -> Mail     : Kirim email reset password\n(berisi link /reset-password/{token}?email=...)
    Mail --> Publik   : Email berisi tautan reset dikirim
    Model --> CtrlLink : status: passwords.sent
    CtrlLink --> Browser : back()->with('status', 'passwords.sent')
    Browser --> Publik  : Tampil pesan "Link reset telah dikirim ke email Anda"
  end
end

== Skenario B: Reset Password via Token ==

Publik -> Browser  : Klik link di email\n(/reset-password/{token}?email=...)
Browser -> CtrlReset : GET /reset-password/{token}\n[middleware: guest]
CtrlReset --> Browser : Inertia::render('Auth/ResetPassword',\n{email, token})
Browser --> Publik   : Tampil form reset password

Publik -> Browser  : Isi password baru + konfirmasi → klik Reset
Browser -> CtrlReset : POST /reset-password\n{token, email, password, password_confirmation}
CtrlReset -> CtrlReset : validate()\ntoken: required\nemail: required|email\npassword: required|confirmed|Password::defaults()
alt Validasi Gagal
  CtrlReset --> Browser : 422 + errors
  Browser --> Publik    : Sorot field yang tidak valid
else Validasi Lolos
  CtrlReset -> Model    : Password::reset({email, password,\npassword_confirmation, token}, callback)
  Model -> DB           : SELECT password_reset_tokens\nWHERE email = ? AND token = ?
  alt Token Tidak Valid / Kadaluarsa
    DB --> Model        : null / expired
    Model --> CtrlReset : status: passwords.token (invalid)
    CtrlReset --> Browser : 422 + {email: 'This password reset token is invalid'}
    Browser --> Publik    : Tampil pesan token tidak valid
  else Token Valid
    DB --> Model        : row token valid
    Model -> Model      : $user->forceFill({\npassword: Hash::make(password),\nremember_token: Str::random(60)\n})->save()
    Model -> Model      : event(new PasswordReset($user))
    Model -> DB         : DELETE password_reset_tokens WHERE email = ?
    Model --> CtrlReset : status: passwords.reset
    CtrlReset --> Browser : redirect(route('login'))\n->with('status', 'passwords.reset')
    Browser --> Publik   : Redirect ke halaman Login\n+ pesan "Password berhasil direset"
  end
end

@enduml
